`--output yaml` prints a block sequence over the same fixture as
`json-output-is-an-array-of-objects`, carrying the same keys in the same order with the same
values — the format changes, the row shape does not.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/alpha/index.md --
---
title: Alpha
status: ready-for-dev
---

body
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/beta/index.md --
---
title: Beta
status: done
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --glob 'plans/*/index.md' --output yaml
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
- title: Alpha
  status: ready-for-dev
  path: plans/alpha/index.md
  slug: alpha
- title: Beta
  status: done
  path: plans/beta/index.md
  slug: beta
-- stderr --
